# Legal surfaces

English is the controlling version. Do not invent processors. `/subprocessors` redirects to `/legal`. Do not list Vercel. DNS is GoDaddy.

Legal pages use the landing-style background. No hero video and no still image. Keep the existing profile phone beside the legal copy. Do not put the copy inside a new phone frame. Do not move the landing hero video onto legal pages.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — legal page plays or freezes the landing reel
<HeroVideo />

// ✅ GOOD — landing background only, copy outside the phone
```
